This flat leather strap is made for all kind of watch. You can ask for a size of band between 18 to 24 mm. But the size can be adjusted to your own need.

This model uses a oiled leather that is dark by nature and become lighter when using it. More info on the leather links above.

You can use any of [the oiled leather](notion:b82a8bf9ee1040e0816e7a0581027cbd) available here.

## The product in stock

The available band is made in 22 mm large, and around 15cm (+ your watch length) to 20cm length maximum.

This watch uses a leather that has chrome-based tanning. Be sure that your skin supports it. If you had any allergic reaction in the past due to “leather allergies” avoid this type of leather.

My [other types](notion:aee11bf74cd9438caa169fdbd90a728b) are safe.

